// Readers for `then`: the rover, the sentinel the heap ends in, and the link
// out of the first island's sentinel, none of which a return value can show.
// They answer as offsets from crt_heap, so a case can name them as literals.
rover_off() {
  word x = peek64((import crt_heap)) - (import crt_heap);
} return word x;
